cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Fibonacci-Pell nearest gaps: an all-exponent classification and quadratic-unit orbit rigidity"
abstract: >-
  Manuscript source and reproduction supplement for a complete classification
  of the strict factor-two Fibonacci-Pell nearest gaps whose quadratic norm
  equals minus the square of their coefficient content. Exactly two such gaps
  occur, and none has an odd exponent. The companion orbit theorem lists every
  Pell-orbit intersection of the two signed Fibonacci cores. The repository
  contains the LaTeX sources, the compiled manuscript, and twenty-one exact
  standard-library certificates with recorded reference output and pinned
  provenance digests.
